ural, crafts, architecture, design and church sectors unite to promote freedom, openness and creativity.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Hunger stones: The history behind 'if you see me, weep'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:543fe6fc2c925dfb7e7e29af5bca06f651aa70dcb52435f062ab87892e250a8a</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:28Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729--a65d352c5848.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Centuries-old hunger stones are emerging as Europe's rivers recede. Among the most famous is the Decin hunger stone in the Elbe River with its cryptic message.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Remembering Dolly Parton: 8 facts about the icon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e805d3cb8c34e3a90d1a4e965a1cafc586e110866bdddfa155c5cf14065874bf</id><updated>2026-08-30T15:57:28Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T18:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/remembering-dolly-parton-8-facts-about-the-icon/a-75503168--7aa2734c090f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/remembering-dolly-parton-8-facts-about-the-icon/a-75503168?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Dolly Parton, one of the world's most successful artists, has died at the age of 80. Here are some important and extraordinary facts about the country music superstar.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry></feed>
